---
import PageFrame from '../../components/PageFrame.astro';
import Switcher from '../../components/layout/Switcher.astro';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PatternDirectory from '../../components/PatternDirectory.astro';
import PatternExample from '../../components/PatternExample.astro';
import '../../styles/pattern-library.css';
---
<Layout title="Pattern Library" description="Find a technique for your game: drawing, movement, input, sound and game structure.">
  <PageFrame opening="compact" class="pattern-library">
    <Switcher as="header" threshold="54rem" limit={2} class="pattern-opening" style="--switcher-space: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 3rem)"><h1>Make one part<br/>work.</h1><div><p>Draw a sprite. Read a controller. Give a game its sound.</p><p>The Pattern Library takes one technique at a time: the code, the machine it needs, and the trade-offs to understand before you adapt it.</p><a href="#directory">Find a technique</a></div></Switcher>
    <section class="pattern-starts" aria-label="Ways into the library">
      <Switcher threshold="39rem" limit={2} class="pattern-feature" style="--switcher-space: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 3rem)"><div><h2><a href="/patterns/sinclair-zx-spectrum/basic/rendering/progress-bar/">Turn a number<br/>into a signal.</a></h2><p>Show health, heat or time remaining with a bar that changes as the value grows.</p><p class="pattern-context">ZX Spectrum · BASIC · Beginner</p></div><PatternExample/></Switcher>
      <Switcher threshold="39rem" limit={2} class="pattern-alternatives" style="--switcher-space: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 3rem)"><article><h3><a href="/patterns/commodore-64/assembly/audio/sid-voice-setup/">Give the C64 a voice.</a></h3><p>Set up a SID voice and get to know the registers behind a sound.</p><span>Commodore 64 · Assembly</span></article><article><h3><a href="/patterns/nintendo-nes/assembly/input/controller-reading/">Listen to the player.</a></h3><p>Read the NES controller and turn button presses into game input.</p><span>NES · Assembly</span></article></Switcher>
    </section>
    <PatternDirectory/>
    <footer class="pattern-next"><h2>Put the pieces together.</h2><p>Try <a href="/patterns/cross-platform/framework/collect-and-respond/">five small programs that connect controls, movement, collision, drawing and sound</a>. For a guided route through a complete game, <a href="/start-here/">start with the lessons</a>. For the hardware and history behind a technique, <a href="/vault/">explore the Vault</a>.</p><p>Working in assembly? <a href="https://github.com/asm198x/asm198x">Asm198x</a> is the family’s assembler and disassembler. <a href="/setup/">Check the setup guide</a> for your machine and the syntax each example needs.</p></footer>
  </PageFrame>
</Layout>
